description	"Ohnaka Gang Member 

A pirate gang member with jury rigged weapons and offensive skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Weeqay Blaster Pistol (2)
- 10% More FP Drain
- 10% Slower Reload, Mag Reload
- Ohnaka Gang Saber
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- BP Free Jumps
- Jury Rigged Slugthrower (Shotgun 2)
-- 1 Shot, Mag Reload
-- Extremely High Velocity
- Homemade Flamerifle
-- Extremely Low Ammo
-- 60% More Damage
-- Mag Reload (2x as long)
-- Slow Movement
- Pulse Grenades (1)

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (2)
- Reinforcements (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Assemble (3)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee]"
